            "Roof state             Winter satisfaction    0.296   0.0091   0.0637    ns   small\n",
            "Roof state             Cluster                0.285   0.0044   0.0411     *   small\n",
            "Air infiltration       Thermal sensation      0.176   0.4655   0.6887    ns   small\n",
            "Air infiltration       Summer satisfaction    0.089   0.9226   0.9226    ns   negl.\n",
